WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:05.583
Good morning.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:07.833
It's the Lord Kitchener,

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:09.500
live and direct.

00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:19.500
-I'm getting out of this place.
-It's our home.

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:25.875
Shit gets real, I'm saving myself.

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.458
-So where do you live?
-Kitchen.

00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:37.375
Is it really like
what they say it's like?

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:40.625
Yeah.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.167
You ain't safe by yourself.

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:51.042
What's your name?

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.375
You ain't built like them.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.458
I haven't got anywhere else to go.

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:03.042
What's he to you?

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:06.208
-A friend of mine.
-Some friend.

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.542
We gotta go.

00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:15.667
What's happening?

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.792
Wanted to know what it's like, right?

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:19.292
This is war.

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:36.000
I wish

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.208
my dad prepared me.

00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.125
My mum, she said

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.250
you never loved her…

00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:00.333
but you would have loved me.

